# #188: Jaina shields out of a dash (frame 7 of the dash), right then left.
# a raises shield the frame it lets go of the stick; b lets go with no input.
# Under shield a brakes by double traction above walk speed, then by traction,
# and stops 5 frames before b's released dash (traction alone).
#! chat -dev quick hero jaina proudmoore
60 a stick 1 0
60 b stick 1 0
66 a stick 0 0
66 a shield 1
66 b stick 0 0
116 a shield 0
130 a stick -1 0
130 b stick -1 0
136 a stick 0 0
136 a shield 1
136 b stick 0 0
186 a shield 0
